# Desktop personality ("CDE" or "FVWM")
Personality FVWM

# Workspace & behavior settings
DeskTopSize 2x2
EdgeResistance 350
FocusStyle SloppyFocus

# Custom Root Menu entries: AddToMenu <MenuName> "<Label>" <Action> [Arg]
AddToMenu RootMenu "Terminal" Exec foot
AddToMenu RootMenu "Files" Exec pcmanfm
AddToMenu RootMenu "Ident" Exec fvwm-ident
AddToMenu RootMenu "Lock" LockSession

# Custom Keybindings: Key <KeyName> <Context> <Modifiers> <Action> [Arg]
Key M A CM TogglePersonality
Key K A CM LockSession
Key Return A M Exec foot

# Auto-start modules when entering FVWM mode
AddToFunc StartFunction
+ I Module fvwm-pager
+ I Module fvwm-buttons
